    "question": "Do unsigned asset-week features built by code from the de-identified fact records of Charter 2 carry information on the realised variance of the next seven days, relative to the other assets of the week, beyond price history up to the decision and beyond attention counts, on the 104 test weeks 2023-01 to 2024-12? Gate: weekly partial correlation of a walk-forward ridge score of the reader features with the target, the history and attention controls removed from both in two steps (a flexible fit on earlier weeks, then a regression within the week), Newey-West t at least 2.0 and positive mean in both years.",
